{"seq":1,"slug":"native-modules","title":"原生模块集成与 N-API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/advanced/native-modules","wordCount":940,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"原生模块集成与-n-api\">原生模块集成与 N-API</h1><p>Electron 应用的 UI 层是 Web 技术，但当需要访问操作系统底层能力（如硬件设备驱动、高性能计算、系统级文件监控、音视频编解码）时，就需要通过原生模块（Native Addon）桥接到 C++、Rust 或其他编译型语言。Node.js 的 N-API（Node-API）提供了稳定的 ABI，使原生模块不因 Node.js 版本升级而需要重新编译——但在 Electron 的多进程环境中，原生模块的加载、编译和安全使用有其特殊性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[Electron 主进程] --&gt; B[Node.js N-API]&#10;    B --&gt; C[原生模块 .node]&#10;    C --&gt; D[C++ 实现]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Rust via napi-rs]&#10;&#10;    F[渲染进程] -.-&gt;|禁止直接加载| C&#10;    F --&gt;|IPC| A&#10;    A --&gt; C&#10;&#10;    G[electron-rebuild] --&gt; H[重编译 → Electron ABI]\">graph TB\n    A[Electron 主进程] --&gt; B[Node.js N-API]\n    B --&gt; C[原生模块 .node]\n    C --&gt; D[C++ 实现]\n    C --&gt; E[Rust via napi-rs]\n\n    F[渲染进程] -.-&gt;|禁止直接加载| C\n    F --&gt;|IPC| A\n    A --&gt; C\n\n    G[electron-rebuild] --&gt; H[重编译 → Electron ABI]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>绑定方式</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>ABI 稳定性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>N-API (node-addon-api)</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n<td>跨 Node 版本稳定</td>\n<td>通用原生扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>napi-rs</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>跨 Node 版本稳定</td>\n<td>内存安全优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>node-ffi-napi</td>\n<td>C（FFI）</td>\n<td>动态绑定</td>\n<td>调用系统 .dll/.dylib</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebAssembly</td>\n<td>C/C++/Rust/Go</td>\n<td>完全跨平台</td>\n<td>纯计算，无需系统调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"n-api-与-node-addon-api\">N-API 与 node-addon-api</h2><p>N-API 是 Node.js 提供的 C 语言级 ABI 稳定接口——用 N-API 编写的原生模块可以跨 Node.js 大版本运行而无需重编译。<code>node-addon-api</code> 是其 C++ 封装层，提供更友好的面向对象 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// addon.cc - 使用 node-addon-api&#10;#include &lt;napi.h&gt;&#10;&#10;Napi::Value ComputeHash(const Napi::CallbackInfo&amp; info) {&#10;    Napi::Env env = info.Env();&#10;&#10;    if (info.Length() &lt; 1 || !info[0].IsBuffer()) {&#10;        Napi::TypeError::New(env, &quot;Expected a Buffer argument&quot;)&#10;            .ThrowAsJavaScriptException();&#10;        return env.Null();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    auto buffer = info[0].As&lt;Napi::Buffer&lt;uint8_t&gt;&gt;();&#10;    // 执行高性能计算...&#10;    uint64_t hash = performHash(buffer.Data(), buffer.Length());&#10;&#10;    return Napi::BigInt::New(env, hash);&#10;}&#10;&#10;Napi::Object Init(Napi::Env env, Napi::Object exports) {&#10;    exports.Set(&quot;computeHash&quot;, Napi::Function::New(env, ComputeHash));&#10;    return exports;&#10;}&#10;&#10;NODE_API_MODULE(addon, Init)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// addon.cc - 使用 node-addon-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;napi.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Value</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ComputeHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CallbackInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Env env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> info.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (info.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IsBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TypeError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(env, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Expected a Buffer argument\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ThrowAsJavaScriptException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> info[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].As</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::Buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;uint8_t>></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 执行高性能计算...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint64_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> performHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BigInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(env, hash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Env</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> exports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"computeHash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Napi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(env, ComputeHash));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exports;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NODE_API_MODULE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(addon, Init)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"rust-原生模块-napi-rs\">Rust 原生模块（napi-rs）</h2><p>napi-rs 是 2024-2026 年增长最快的 Electron 原生模块编写方式。它将 Rust 的内存安全保证带入原生模块开发，同时通过过程宏提供极简的 API 定义体验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// src/lib.rs&#10;use napi_derive::napi;&#10;use napi::bindgen_prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[napi]&#10;pub fn compute_hash(data: Buffer) -&gt; u64 {&#10;    // Rust 保证不会有内存泄漏或缓冲区溢出&#10;    let bytes = data.as_ref();&#10;    xxhash_rust::xxh3::xxh3_64(bytes)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[napi]&#10;pub async fn compress_file(path: String) -&gt; Result&lt;Buffer&gt; {&#10;    let content = tokio::fs::read(&amp;path).await&#10;        .map_err(|e| Error::new(Status::GenericFailure, e.to_string()))?;&#10;    let compressed = zstd::encode_all(&amp;content[..], 3)&#10;        .map_err(|e| Error::new(Status::GenericFailure, e.to_string()))?;&#10;    Ok(Buffer::from(compressed))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// src/lib.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use napi_derive::napi;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use napi::bindgen_prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[napi]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn compute_hash(data: Buffer) -> u64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Rust 保证不会有内存泄漏或缓冲区溢出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let bytes = data.as_ref();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    xxhash_rust::xxh3::xxh3_64(bytes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[napi]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn compress_file(path: String) -> Result&#x3C;Buffer> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = tokio::fs::read(&#x26;path).await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| Error::new(Status::GenericFailure, e.to_string()))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let compressed = zstd::encode_all(&#x26;content[..], 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| Error::new(Status::GenericFailure, e.to_string()))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(Buffer::from(compressed))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>napi-rs 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rust 编译器保证内存安全，消除 C++ 原生模块中常见的 use-after-free 和缓冲区溢出</li>\n<li>支持 async/await，与 Node.js 的异步模型自然对接</li>\n<li>编译产物是标准的 <code>.node</code> 文件，加载方式与 C++ 模块完全一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"electron-rebuild-工作原理\">electron-rebuild 工作原理</h2><p>Electron 内置的 Node.js 版本与系统安装的 Node.js 版本不同（ABI 不兼容）。通过 npm 安装的原生模块是针对系统 Node.js 编译的，直接加载到 Electron 中会 crash。<code>electron-rebuild</code> 解决这个问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 重编译 node_modules 中的所有原生模块&#10;npx electron-rebuild&#10;&#10;# 或在 package.json 中配置为 postinstall 钩子&#10;{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;postinstall&quot;: &quot;electron-rebuild&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重编译 node_modules 中的所有原生模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> electron-rebuild</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或在 package.json 中配置为 postinstall 钩子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    \"postinstall\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"electron-rebuild\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>其原理是用 Electron 的 Node.js 头文件和 ABI 版本号重新编译所有 <code>.node</code> 文件。常见问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Python 和 C++ 编译工具链（<code>windows-build-tools</code> / <code>xcode-select</code> / <code>build-essential</code>）必须预先安装</li>\n<li>交叉编译（如在 x64 机器上为 arm64 构建）需要额外配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"原生模块的安全边界\">原生模块的安全边界</h2><p>原生模块只能在主进程或工具进程中加载——渲染进程默认启用沙箱，无法加载 <code>.node</code> 文件。正确的架构是将原生调用封装在主进程的 IPC handler 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts&#10;import { nativeAddon } from &#39;./native-addon&#39;;&#10;&#10;ipcMain.handle(&#39;native:hash&#39;, async (_event, data: Buffer) =&gt; {&#10;  return nativeAddon.computeHash(data);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// preload.ts&#10;contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld(&#39;nativeAPI&#39;, {&#10;  computeHash: (data: ArrayBuffer) =&gt; ipcRenderer.invoke(&#39;native:hash&#39;, Buffer.from(data)),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { nativeAddon } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './native-addon'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ipcMain.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'native:hash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nativeAddon.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// preload.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">contextBridge.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exposeInMainWorld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'nativeAPI'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  computeHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ipcRenderer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">invoke</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'native:hash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式确保即使渲染进程被 XSS 攻陷，攻击者也无法直接调用原生代码——所有原生调用都必须通过主进程 handler 的输入验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时选择-webassembly-替代\">何时选择 WebAssembly 替代</h2><p>如果原生模块的目的是纯计算（不需要文件 I/O、网络、系统调用），WebAssembly 可能是更好的选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>原生模块</th>\n<th>WebAssembly</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>接近原生</td>\n<td>原生的 80-95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>需为每个 OS/arch 编译</td>\n<td>一份 .wasm 通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>可执行任意系统调用</td>\n<td>沙箱内，无系统调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分发复杂度</td>\n<td>高（prebuild 或用户编译）</td>\n<td>低（随 JS 一起分发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>系统集成、硬件访问</td>\n<td>纯计算、编解码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>N-API 提供 ABI 稳定的原生模块接口，跨 Node.js 版本无需重编译</li>\n<li>napi-rs 是 Rust 原生模块的首选方案，兼具内存安全与高性能</li>\n<li>electron-rebuild 确保原生模块针对 Electron 的 Node.js ABI 正确编译</li>\n<li>原生模块只在主进程/工具进程加载，渲染进程通过 IPC 间接调用</li>\n<li>纯计算场景优先考虑 WebAssembly，避免原生模块的跨平台分发复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/security-architecture\">安全架构三支柱</a>——理解为什么渲染进程不能直接加载原生模块</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hubs/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/js-wasm-interop\">WebAssembly Web 集成</a>——Wasm 作为原生模块替代方案的详细对比</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原生模块集成与 N-API","id":"原生模块集成与-n-api"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"N-API 与 node-addon-api","id":"n-api-与-node-addon-api"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust 原生模块（napi-rs）","id":"rust-原生模块-napi-rs"},{"level":2,"text":"electron-rebuild 工作原理","id":"electron-rebuild-工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"原生模块的安全边界","id":"原生模块的安全边界"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选择 WebAssembly 替代","id":"何时选择-webassembly-替代"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"渲染性能与帧率优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/rendering-optimization"},"next":{"title":"应用打包分发与自动更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/advanced/packaging-distribution"}}